[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5640.47, "timestamp": "01:34:00", "text": "对手方面的事情，我真的很想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5643.189, "timestamp": "01:34:03", "text": "成为她的第一个孩子。我真希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5647.35, "timestamp": "01:34:07", "text": "努力工作赚钱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5650.31, "timestamp": "01:34:10", "text": "有足够的钱来以某种方式委托"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5652.39, "timestamp": "01:34:12", "text": "模型，而不是委托"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5654.47, "timestamp": "01:34:14", "text": "模型。把维修工作完成。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5656.79, "timestamp": "01:34:16", "text": "这是剩下的主要问题了。该模型是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5658.709, "timestamp": "01:34:18", "text": "完成了，对吧？剩下的维修工作就交给别人了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5662.87, "timestamp": "01:34:22", "text": "出去。然后给模型绑定骨骼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5665.95, "timestamp": "01:34:25", "text": "以及所有的一切，实际上首次亮相或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5668.55, "timestamp": "01:34:28", "text": "某物。是的。尽快"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5671.99, "timestamp": "01:34:31", "text": "今年。我希望我能通过我的首秀来展示它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5674.709, "timestamp": "01:34:34", "text": "其实就在我生日那天，但我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5676.83, "timestamp": "01:34:36", "text": "我觉得是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5678.99, "timestamp": "01:34:38", "text": "可能的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5681.43, "timestamp": "01:34:41", "text": "呃，我觉得这不可能，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5684.83, "timestamp": "01:34:44", "text": "索具安装需要3个月时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5689.75, "timestamp": "01:34:49", "text": "至少。是的。现在已经是五月下旬了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5692.669, "timestamp": "01:34:52", "text": "五月。所以如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5696.35, "timestamp": "01:34:56", "text": "如果我有足够的钱，我就可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5699.79, "timestamp": "01:34:59", "text": "我本可以"}]